<title>UK: SOCCER-MILOSEVIC DEAL NEARS COMPLETION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MILOSEVIC DEAL NEARS COMPLETION.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavian striker Savo Milosevic is set to complete his 4.5 million pounds ($7.4 million) transfer from Aston Villa to Perugia after his country's World Cup qualifier against the Czech Republic on Sunday.</p>
<p>The fee appeared to have presented problems but Villa manager Brian Little said on Monday that he expected the transfer to be finalised after the match in Belgrade.</p>
<p>&quot;I have spoken to Savo and my understanding is that he has agreed personal terms. We are now waiting for the paperwork to go back from one club to the other,&quot; said Little.</p>
</text>
